      "claim": "Fairtrade International’s certification scheme only applies to product categories listed in its official eligible‑product list, which does not include electronic devices.",
      "evidence": "Fairtrade International’s 2023‑2024 ‘Eligible Product Categories’ document lists coffee, tea, cocoa, bananas, cotton, sugar, etc., and explicitly states that electronics are outside the scope of the Fairtrade Standard.",
