      "id": 4,
      "claim": "Because no laptop meets the Fairtrade certification criteria, a laptop cannot be purchased that is officially labeled as “Fair Trade”.",
      "evidence": "The Fairtrade label may only be applied to products that have been certified under the Fairtrade Standard; absence of certification means the label cannot be used legally.",
