      "answer": "Yes",
      "reason_rejected": "Claims that certain laptops are “ethical” or use responsibly sourced minerals (e.g., Fairphone, Framework) refer to corporate responsibility, B‑Corp, or conflict‑free mineral initiatives, not to the official Fairtrade International certification required for a product to be called “Fair Trade”. No laptop carries the Fairtrade label."
